		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Thick clouds of mosquitoes flit around this murk-ooze. Loves sending bog minions to assault mortal villages.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 45, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tendril +5 (1d8) or release swarm, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Acid immune</p><p></p><p><strong>Release Swarm</strong>. Release 1d4 mosquito swarms, which assist blight for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Unquiet Bog</strong>. Mortals dying in domain rise as swamp mummies at midnight.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
